{"id":"document-new","title":"Read a document","summary":"Read with a stated purpose and a route for questions","timing":"anytime","body":"Read the material for the supplied purpose: $reading_material\nUse these questions and discussion route: $reading_questions\n\nIdentify the decisions or actions the material informs, not just whether\nyou opened it. Note uncertainties and confirm stale or contradictory\ninstructions with its owner. Do not paste restricted content into an\nonboarding record. Use separate activities for reading assignments whose\noutcomes need independent discussion or follow-up.","variables":[{"name":"reading_material","description":"Which current document should be read and for what work purpose?","type":"string","required":true,"audience":"onboarder"},{"name":"reading_questions","description":"Which questions should guide the reading and who can discuss them?","type":"string","required":true,"audience":"onboarder"}],"steps":[{"id":"discuss-reading","name":"Explain the reading's useful implications","checks":[{"ask":"Can you explain how the document informs your work and raise any unresolved questions through the supplied route?"}]}]}
